<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-18249] ignite-cdc not stop on client node crash</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-18249</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In case&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;client node inside &lt;tt&gt;IgniteToIgniteCdcConsumer&lt;/tt&gt; stops due to connection loss&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;AND no new CDC events&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;ignite-cdc process not stopped and continue to work.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This must be fixed - ignite-cdc must stop&#160;immediately on client node crash.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
